Day 48 of #DrGVishwanathanChallenge
Continuing my DSA journey with two more Binary Tree problems

Day 48 -LeetCode 110: (Balanced Binary Tree)
I used DFS + recursion to calculate the height of each subtree and check whether the difference between the left and right subtree heights is greater than 1.
I used -1 as a signal for an unbalanced subtree, which also helps avoid unnecessary calculations.

TC: O(n)
SC: O(h)- recursion stack
